    "rule": "CSS Overflow Level 3 \u00a73.1: if either axis is scrollable (hidden, auto, or scroll), visible on the other axis computes to auto and clip computes to hidden. This fixture authors visible on the non-target axis, so clip stays clip and the non-target axis becomes auto only for hidden/auto/scroll target values.",
